OCPROJECT 1
# The navigation bake's test level. No scripts, no C#, no classes -- three boxes and a floor.
#
# It exists because Bake Navigation cannot be checked without a world that has collision in it, and
# every other project in test-content is built out of `class` placements, which get NO physics body
# from anywhere in this engine. A navmesh baked against one of those would be empty and correct.
#
# CREATEDWITH tracks the current engine version on purpose: an older value raises the project-upgrade
# modal on load, and a modal blocks the headless run this map is meant to be driven by.
NAME NavRange
ENGINE Aver 0.3.0
CREATEDWITH 0.3.0
CONTENT Content
STARTMAP Maps/NavRange.ocmap
